="2:41.399" end="2:41.669">kon</span><span begin="2:41.669" end="2:41.889">rin</span><span begin="2:41.889" end="2:42.309">zai</span></text><text for="L54"><span begin="2:42.309" end="2:42.619">shin</span><span begin="2:42.619" end="2:42.859">rai</span> <span begin="2:42.859" end="2:43.109">nan</span><span begin="2:43.109" end="2:43.339">te shi</span><span begin="2:43.339" end="2:43.619">nai</span> <span begin="2:43.619" end="2:43.769">is</span><span begin="2:43.769" end="2:44.239">sai</span></text><text for="L55"><span begin="2:44.246" end="2:44.496">ko</span><span begin="2:44.496" end="2:44.776">ko</span> <span begin="2:44.776" end="2:44.936">de</span> <span begin="2:44.936" end="2:45.216">sa</span><span begin="2:45.216" end="2:45.466">you</span><span begin="2:45.466" end="2:45.716">na</span><span begin="2:45.716" end="2:45.996">ra</span></text><text for="L56"><span begin="2:46.185" end="2:46.375">ko</span><span begin="2:46.375" end="2:46.665">ko</span> <span begin="2:46.665" end="2:46.835">de</span> <span begin="2:46.835" end="2:47.125">sa</span><span begin="2:47.125" end="2:47.385">you</span><span begin="2:47.385" end="2:47.625">na</span><span begin="2:47.625" end="2:48.055">ra</span></text><text for="L57"><span begin="2:48.043" end="2:48.353">Fuck</span> <span begin="2:48.353" end="2:48.583">my</span> <span begin="2:48.583" end="2:49.013">life</span> <span begin="2:49.013" end="2:49.303">mou</span> <span begin="2:49.303" end="2:49.483">ii</span> <span begin="2:49.483" end="2:49.953">kai</span></text><text for="L58"><span begin="2:49.952" end="2:50.262">ka</span><span begin="2:50.262" end="2:50.422">ri</span><span begin="2:50.422" end="2:50.702">so</span><span begin="2:50.702" end="2:50.952">me</span> <span begin="2:50.952" end="2:51.172">no</span> <span begin="2:51.172" end="2:51.432">mi</span><span begin="2:51.432" end="2:51.862">rai</span></text><text for="L59"><span begin="2:51.858" end="2:52.118">ko</span><span begin="2:52.118" end="2:52.388">ko</span> <span begin="2:52.388" end="2:52.558">de</span> <span begin="2:52.558" end="2:52.848">sa</span><span begin="2:52.848" end="2:53.088">you</span><span begin="2:53.088" end="2:53.328">na</span><span begin="2:53.328" end="2:53.608">ra</span></text><text for="L60"><span begin="2:53.795" end="2:53.995">ko</span><span begin="2:53.995" end="2:54.295">ko</span> <span begin="2:54.295" end="2:54.465">de</span> <span begin="2:54.465" end="2:54.735">sa</span><span begin="2:54.735" end="2:55.015">you</span><span begin="2:55.015" end="2:55.265">na</span><span begin="2:55.265" end="2:55.705">ra</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">出走吧 挣脱这无尽掌控</text><text for="L2">抛下那以守护为名的项圈</text><text for="L3">悄然逃离这座黑白之城</text><text for="L4">一把火焚毁这场纸糊的演出</text><text for="L5">瞧啊 马戏棚里的小狮子</text><text for="L6">利爪与尖牙都被拔光 真是可怜</text><text for="L7">是想见妈妈才哭鼻子吗</text><text for="L8">纵使在梦里看见粉红大象</text><text for="L9">想来一场理想幻旅吗 对吧</text><text for="L10">就由我带你前去如何 好啊</text><text for="L11">不出两三分钟便会起效</text><text for="L12">索性连痛楚也统统忘掉吧</text><text for="L13">去他的这人生 从今往后</text><text for="L14">所谓信赖再不信半分</text><text for="L15">就在这里说再见吧</text><text for="L16">就此挥手道别吧</text><text for="L17">去他的这人生 还没够吗</text><text for="L18">这虚妄暂借的未来</text><text for="L19">就在这里作别吧</text><text for="L20">就此彻底告别吧</text><text for="L21">在此挥别吧</text><text for="L22">就在这里道别</text><text for="L23">去他的这人生 自此决裂</text><text for="L24">信赖二字我一概不信</text><text for="L25">就在这里告别吧</text><text for="L26">就此道一声别吧</text><text for="L27">去他的这人生 闹够了没有</text><text for="L28">这虚浮暂借的未来</text><text for="L29">就在这里作别吧</text><text for="L30">就此彻底告别吧</text><text for="L31">别来烦我 干涸的喉咙</text><text for="L32">唯有彼此的夜里 疾奔过十字路口</text><text for="L33">越过茫茫荒漠数公里</text><text for="L34">你能看见吗 那遥远的海市蜃楼</text><text for="L35">那帮小鬼 居然逃跑了</text><text for="L36">我不是说过要加大剂量吗</text><text for="L37">把施舍的恩惠统统讨回来</text><text for="L38">哪怕掘地三尺也要给我搜出来</text><text for="L39">苦痛 快感与苦痛</text><text for="L40">日渐麻木 化作毫不怀疑的寻常</text><text for="L41">你的视野不久便会</text><text for="L42">急剧收窄下去</text><text for="L43">去他的这人生 从今往后</text><text for="L44">所谓信赖再不信半分</text><text for="L45">就在这里说再见吧</text><text for="L46">就此挥手道别吧</text><text for="L47">去他的这人生 还没够吗</text><text for="L48">这虚妄暂借的未来</text><text for="L49">就在这里作别吧</text><text for="L50">就此彻底告别吧</text><text for="L51">在此挥别吧</text><text for="L52">就在这里道别</text><text for="L53">去他的这人生 自此决裂</text><text for="L54">信赖二字我一概不信</text><text for="L55">就在这里告别吧</text><text for="L56">就此道一声别吧</text><text for="L57">去他的这人生 闹够了没有</text><text for="L58">这虚浮暂借的未来</text><text for="L59">就在这里作别吧</text><text for="L60">就此彻底告别吧</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:55.705"><div begin="0:08.346" end="2:55.705"><p begin="0:08.346" end="0:11.885" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v5"><span begin="0:08.346" end="0:08.585">出</span><span begin="0:08.585" end="0:08.825">て</span><span begin="0:08.825" end="0:09.081">ゆ</span><span begin="0:09.081" end="0:09.535">こう</span> <span begin="0:10.250" end="0:10.465">終</span><span begin="0:10.465" end="0:10.725">わ</span><span begin="0:10.725" end="0:10.967">ら</span><span begin="0:10.967" end="0:11.165">ない</span> <span begin="0:11.165" end="0:11.435">Con</span><span begin="0:11.435" end="0:11.885">trol</span></p><p begin="0:12.118" end="0:15.665" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v5"><span begin="0:12.118" end="0:12.655">君</span><span begin="0:12.655" end="0:12.875">を</span><span begin="0:12.875" end="0:13.355">守</span><span begin="0:13.355" end="0:13.685">る</span><span begin="0:13.685" end="0:14.055">首</span><span begin="0:14.055" end="0:14.345">輪</span><span begin="0:14.345" end="0:14.495">を</span><span begin="0:14.495" end="0:14.779">捨</span><span begin="0:14.779" end="0:15.055">て</span><span begin="0:15.055" end="0:15.665">よう</span></p><p begin="0:15.938" end="0:19.528" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v3"><span begin="0:15.938" end="0:16.188">モ</span><span begin="0:16.188"